{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2022-02-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER SECURES FIRST HIGH VOLTAGE EFAN SYSTEM WIN', 'text': 'AUBURN HILLS, MICH., FEB. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER HAS BEEN SELECTED BY A MAJOR EUROPEAN COMMERCIAL VEHICLE OEM TO PROVIDE ITS EFAN SYSTEM FOR BATTERY-POWERED LONG-HAUL ROAD TRANSPORT VEHICLES.'}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2022-02-15 06:30:00', 'title': "BORGWARNER TO ACQUIRE SANTROLL'S LIGHT VEHICLE EMOTOR BUSINESS", 'text': "AUBURN HILLS, MICH., FEB. 15, 2022 \xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER INC. (NYSE: BWA), SANTROLL ELECTRIC AUTO AND SANTROLL AUTOMOTIVE COMPONENTS TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE SIGNED AN EQUITY TRANSFER AGREEMENT (ETA) UNDER WHICH BORGWARNER WILL ACQUIRE SANTROLL AUTOMOTIVE COMPONENTS, A CARVE-OUT OF SANTROLL'S EMOTOR BUSINESS, FOR UP TO ¥1.4 BILLION, COMPRISED OF A CLOSING PAYMENT OF ¥1.1 BILLION AND AN EARNOUT OF UP TO ¥0.3 BILLION."}